EdkCompatibilityPkg provides header files and libraries that enable you to build the [[EDK]] module in UEFI 2.0 + Framework 0.9x mode. This package also provides Thunk modules that enable Framework 0.9x modules to work with [[UEFI]] 2.3.1 / PI 1.2 [http://www.tianocore.org/edk2/ EDK II] Platforms.
